@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #375A7F
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 70
top to bottom direction
title Event Confirm — Application architecture
caption Go backend (backend/) replaced the Node api/*.mjs and server/*.mjs modules.

component "Browser: React + Vite\nPages / components / hooks\nSession + campaign persistence\nBotnoi client + audio Web Worker" as Browser #EAF2FF
component "HTTP routes\n/event-confirm/api/*\nGo net/http (backend/main.go)\nalso serves the built SPA" as API #F1F5FA
component "Go handlers (backend/)\nvoice: auth, routing, ownership\nconnection: encrypted credentials\nResults / recordings / events\nAgent setup / inbound / scheduler" as Server #F1F5FA
database "Supabase\nAuth + PostgreSQL + RLS\nCampaigns / call requests / jobs\nConnections / setup audits\nWorker heartbeat" as DB #E7F5ED
component "Shared domain rules\nshared/*.mjs\nInputs / queue / schedules\nCall results / audio repair" as Shared #FFF8DF
cloud "Botnoi Voice Bot\nProvider REST API + logs/audio\nLive preview WebSocket" as Provider #FFF1E5
component "Optional scheduler trigger\nSupabase pg_cron + pg_net\nProvisioned separately" as Cron #F3EAFE

Browser -down-> API : Supabase session JWT
API -down-> Server : handlers
Browser -right-> DB : Auth + user-scoped RLS/RPC
Server -right-> DB : authorized persistence
Server -down-> Provider : linked provider account token
Provider -left-> API : result / recording callbacks
Browser ..> Shared : shared rules
Server ..> Shared : Go ports, golden-tested
Cron -right-> API : authenticated scheduler tick
Browser --> Provider : ephemeral preview WebSocket

legend bottom left
  Stored provider tokens: AES-256-GCM, server-side only.
  Service-role access requires explicit owner/account checks.
  Browser uses a temporary token for live preview.
  Scheduler uses SQL leases and request reservations.
endlegend
@enduml
